<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar, firms on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar, firms on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against the dollar on Monday, but firmed on the pound, foreign exchange dealers at commercial banks said.</p>
<p>The rupee was trading at a mean commercial rate of 20.4135 against the dollar from Friday's 20.3360. The rupee firmed to a mean of 31.8615 on the pound from 31.8715 last Friday.</p>
</text>
